    {
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Post-Once-Everywhere (n8n + Blotato)\n**1.** Make a copy of the free Google Sheet template (link in README). Put each video: Title, Media URL (Google Drive link), Caption, Status = `Ready To Post`.\n**2.** Connect a **Google Sheets** credential (OAuth) on the two Google Sheets nodes, and paste your sheet ID.\n**3.** Create a free [Blotato](https://blotato.com) account, copy your **API key**, and add it as the Blotato credential on every Blotato node. Connect your social accounts inside Blotato.\n**4.** Set your Facebook Page ID / Pinterest Board ID where shown (other platforms auto-use your connected accounts).\n**5.** Activate. Every 15 min it finds a 'Ready To Post' row, uploads the video, posts to all 9 platforms, and flips Status to Posted (or Errored).\nNote: the n8n workflow and sheet are free; Blotato posting uses its 7-day free trial then a paid plan (it handles the platform APIs/app reviews for you).",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "1f3ac82b-ee6f-4ac7-ba24-9c1128abcdb9"
    }
  ],
